    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[0]'
      value: <SFX_liezel_concerned><i>(I am absolutely certain that the bookmark
        was written by Servillano. This note somehow matches it exactly. Word per
        word.)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[1]'
      value: <i>(Then, was he the one that buried that box?)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 8439490232393766861, guid: f8e102a253b7a4c509f8ea79c303fd6a, type: 3}
      propertyPath: 'dialogue.sentences.Array.data[2]'
      value: <i>(Why? If this was one of his antics with Ate Lorena, then it would
        have been found long ago and not by Santi. Did something actually happen
        to him? Is this writing supposed to warn us about Giyala?)</i>
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
